    "$t": "台語sa攏有 - 〈保正伯〉kap〈放屎百姓〉: 蔡秋桐ê台語小說"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">〈保正伯〉kap〈放屎百姓〉:&nbsp;</span></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">蔡秋桐ê台語小說</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">主講／陳淑容&nbsp; &nbsp;記錄／蔡玉薰</h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margi